# Exclude sensitive/generated files at any depth, including accidental nested copies.
**/__pycache__
**/.env*
**/*.session*
**/*.db*
**/*.sqlite*
**/credentials*.json
**/token*.json
**/client_secret*.json
**/authorized_user*.json
**/.secrets
**/secrets
**/backups
